contentText:
The ZOMBIES family is paying tribute to Carla Jeffery.

Following news of the actress&#8217; death Tuesday at age 33, Jeffery&#8217;s co-stars and friends have taken to social media to share memories of the performer, who played Bree in the first three installments of Disney Channel&#8217;s ZOMBIES movie musical franchise. Across Instagram posts, Stories and comments, those who knew her remembered her fondly, reminiscing on her infectious laugh, boundless positivity and the joy she brought into every room.

